<title>UK: Bankers Trust sets warrants on mark/U.S. dollar.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets warrants on mark/U.S. dollar.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Effecten GmbH has issued 1.2 million Quattro-style warrants, in four equal tranches, on the mark/U.S. dollar rate, lead manager Bankers Trust International said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS		RANGE		 ISS PRICE</p>
<p> TRANCHE A	     1.46-1.58	   2.00 DEM</p>
<p> TRANCHE B	     1.47-1.56	   2.00 DEM</p>
<p> TRANCHE C	     1.48-1.59	   2.00 DEM</p>
<p> TRANCHE D	     1.45-1.54	   2.00 DEM</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   30.MAY.97		 PAYDATE	04.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   BER FFT DDF HAM STG   MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
